Landesbank Rheinland-Pfalz has instead acquired Landesbank Baden-Württemberg from Stuttgart.
Even so, there have been repeated speculations about Deka-Bank's mergings with land-based banks.
However, Günther Merl, Chairman of the Board of Directors of Helaba, has recently commented negatively on speculation about the merger of his financial house with others.
